 the lower end harmony spectrum.<br /> <br /> Edit: also on the same page as Bunyip on this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T07:25:21-08:00","id":763086,"title":"","content":"There's humans who have sex with dogs and a wide variety of other animals, without the benefit of being able to speak with them, turn into something similar, or join them in the mystical union of the Pack. I wouldn't expect it to be common practice but I'm sure it happens.<br /> <br /> At the lower end of the Harmony spectrum I'd expect more sex with spirits than animals, as low Harmony isn't about being bestial.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T08:27:44-08:00","id":763138,"title":"","content":"Do spirits actually have sex though? Or do they just think concepts into reality?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T09:11:59-08:00","id":763165,"title":"","content":"I don't believe they have sex on their own, unless they're sex or sex related spirits, or a spirit with its own personality that enjoys having sex for one reason or another.<br /> <br /> But in the fiction the idea of werewolves having sex with spirits pops up a couple times. Most memorably to me, in the Idigam Fiction Anthology there's this quote.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Fuck Lee Godspeaker. Godspeaker's a weasel and the Shadow's whore. He don't cleave to man, you know. Godspeaker finds more to do with the spirit courts than just speak. </div> </div> </div>Which, I'll grant, can just be shit-talking. But werewolves are people too and not immune to the eccentricities of humankind. Again I don't think it's common, except perhaps among the Fire-Touched, I just wouldn't rule any of it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-11T14:37:39-08:00","id":763481,"title":"","content":"Suppose a harmony 2 werewolf would be just as spirit as anything else. Fu