was a perfect image of a gauru werewolf) that is immune to most gifts. No abortion subtext necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T10:36:03-08:00","id":764190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/759001-the-father-s-form?p=764129#post764129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lyrics meant low Harmony werewolves having sex with spirits, not with other low Harmony werewolves. Unless you were counting spirits as people. And since it would be a more spirit-heavy thing, instead of the 'Black Birth' you could have the pregnancy be entirely spiritual or something only the spirit deals with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, in that context I did use &quot;people&quot; to refer to spirits. I suppose it makes the whole thing less literal, but for me it doesn't really resolve the problems with the concept. I'd personally prefer Unihar to come from something other than just reproducing in the wrong way. If it works for you though, awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T11:04:12-08:00","id":764210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/759001-the-father-s-form?p=764190#post764190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, in that context I did use &quot;people&quot; to refer to spirits. I suppose it makes the whole thing less literal, but for me it doesn't really resolve the problems with the concept. I'd personally prefer Unihar to come from something other than just reproducing in the wrong way. If it works for you though, awesome!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm surprised, most people here seem to have very clear views on what they consider people and the farther away you get from a base human without a template, the less regard they have for them.<br /> <br /> I'm in no rush to re-install unihar, they were sort of a one note wonder and the strix does the concept much better. But it does seem like every topic about werewolf sex does end up with suggestions on how unihar can come into being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T11:45:20-08:00","id":764247,"title":"","content":"Let's get real here. Spirits aren't people. <br /> <br /> <b>Ducks before the Tumblr users find him.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T11:49:16-08:00","id":764252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/759001-the-father-s-form?p=764210#post764210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised, most people here seem to have very clear views on what they consider people and the farther away you get from a base human without a template, the less regard they have for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I am not even sure &quot;person&quot; can be defined, but to me if an entity has consciousness, it may very well be a person. But the personhood or lack thereof of spirits isn't really the crux of my issue, it's just that the wrong kinds of sex lead to vengeful aberrant babies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/759001-the-father-s-form?p=764210#post764210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm in no rush to re-install unihar, they were sort of a one note wonder and the strix does the concept much better. But it does seem like every topic about werewolf sex does end up with suggestions on how unihar can come into being.</div> </div> </div> </div>That does seem to be the case. I like Unihar as the werewolf equivalent of Strix, I just don't like them as <s>God's</s> Luna's punishment for procreating in a way She doesn't approve of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 11-12-2015, 02:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-12T12:02:03-08:00","id":764268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/759001-the-father-s-form?p=764252#post764252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just don't like them as <s>God's</s> Luna's punishment for procreating in a way She doesn't approve of.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this might be our difference, I always saw it as more of a hindrance of the process than a curse or punishment handed on down from high. Werewolves being not quite spirit and not quite human mating with other werewolves who are not quite spirits and not quite humans just not working due to how their systems work, and the unihar the spiritual result of that.<br /> <br /> But like I said I'm in no hurry to have them back. As it is werewolves have tons of antagonists and unihar were pretty one dimensional compared to similar things you could have, like Pure ghosts or Fire-Touched ancestral spirits.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}